  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Genomic DNA was isolated from an exponentially growing culture of strain PhosAc3 using the protocol of Marteinsson et al. [Int J Syst Bacteriol. 45:623–632(1995)]."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "The pH was adjusted to 6.8, resazurin (1 mg liter-1) was added, and the medium was autoclaved for 20 min."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "The following solutions, which had been sterilized by filtration, were then added:"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "comment": "Anaerobiosis was achieved by applying a vacuum to the medium and saturating it with N2(2)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "comment": "Finally. the medium was reduced by adding a sterile solution of Na2S-9H2O (final concentration, 0.025% [wt/vol])."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "comment": "pH to 7.0 with KOH"
    }
  ]
}